---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const scriptUrl = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}checkup-workflow-lab.js`;
const moneyFields = [
  ['monthlyTakeHome', 'Monthly take-home income', '4200'],
  ['monthlyExpenses', 'Recurring monthly expenses', '3650'],
  ['additionalDebtPayments', 'Additional monthly debt payments', '850'],
];
---
<Base title="Bankruptcy Checkup Beta Workflow (Interactive)" description="Test the attached guide's eleven-question order against the Checkup's real LangGraph steps using invented examples." searchable={false}>
  <section class="lab-main wrap">
    <p class="lab-kicker">GOBK · DEVELOPMENT WORKSPACE</p>
    <h1>Bankruptcy Checkup Beta Workflow (Interactive)</h1>
    <p class="lab-lead">Change invented answers in the attached guide's eleven-question order, run the real graph and inspect why its starting point changes.</p>
    <p>This tab runs the real LangGraph library on this device, using the Checkup's existing calculation and validation code. A node is a step, an edge connects steps, and state is the information carried between them.</p>
    <p class="lab-decision-explanation">The roadmap is deterministic: the same supported answers follow the same decision path. The <strong>Build the issue list and discussion path</strong> node uses ordinary TypeScript to choose attorney-help priority and whether Chapter 7, Chapter 13, both chapters or clarification should come first.</p>
    <div class="lab-notice">Use invented examples only. The gross-income band is not a means test, equity does not establish an exemption, and prior-case recency does not calculate a waiting period. Changes here affect this sandbox. The public <a href="/bankruptcy-checkup-beta-v2">Bankruptcy Checkup (Beta V2)</a> keeps its hosted server workflow.</div>
    <noscript><p>This interactive tab needs JavaScript. The <a href="/bankruptcy-checkup-beta-workflow">written workflow explanation</a> is available without it.</p></noscript>
    <section id="checkup-workflow-lab" aria-label="Interactive Checkup workflow">
      <div class="lab-toolbar">
        <button type="button" id="lab-run" class="lab-primary">Run draft</button>
        <button type="button" id="lab-step">Step through</button>
        <button type="button" id="lab-next" disabled>Next step</button>
        <button type="button" id="lab-stop" disabled>Stop</button>
        <button type="button" id="lab-reset">Reset workflow</button>
        <span id="lab-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading the real LangGraph library…</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lab-workspace">
        <section class="lab-panel lab-editor" aria-labelledby="lab-editor-title">
          <h2 id="lab-editor-title">1. Edit the draft</h2>
          <label for="lab-title">Draft name</label><input id="lab-title" maxlength="100" value="My Checkup workflow draft" />
          <label for="lab-limit-placement">Place the legal-limits step</label>
          <select id="lab-limit-placement"><option value="after_calculation">After the calculation (current Beta)</option><option value="after_capabilities">After checking capabilities</option><option value="before_calculation">Before the calculation</option></select>
          <label for="lab-calculation-scope">Calculation scope</label>
          <select id="lab-calculation-scope"><option value="full">Before and after separate debt payments</option><option value="before_only">Before debt payments only</option></select>
          <label for="lab-checkpoint-placement">Add a review checkpoint</label>
          <select id="lab-checkpoint-placement"><option value="off">No checkpoint (current Beta)</option><option value="after_validation">After checking answers</option><option value="after_calculation">After the calculation</option><option value="before_rendering">Before assembling the result</option></select>
          <label for="lab-review-note">Checkpoint review note</label><textarea id="lab-review-note" maxlength="600" rows="3" placeholder="For example: review missing answers before showing the result."></textarea>
          <p class="lab-small">Moving the limits step changes real graph edges. A checkpoint adds a real graph node with a review note. The scope control changes the draft's calculation plan. You are manipulating draft steps and supported calculations; you cannot enable legal assessment rules. Notes are for reviewers and do not change the roadmap's source-backed guidance.</p>
          <details><summary>Why some steps stay fixed</summary><p>Answers must be checked before calculating. Explanations need the calculation first, and the completed output must be checked last. Those dependencies stay in place. No legal rules can be enabled here.</p></details>
          <h3>Share a draft</h3>
          <div class="lab-share-actions"><button type="button" id="lab-share">Create draft link</button><button type="button" id="lab-export">Download draft</button></div>
          <label class="lab-small" for="lab-import">Open a saved draft (.json)</label><input id="lab-import" type="file" accept="application/json,.json" />
          <details><summary>Open or edit draft JSON</summary><label for="lab-json">Workflow settings as JSON</label><textarea id="lab-json" rows="5" maxlength="8192" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Paste the contents of a saved workflow draft."></textarea><button type="button" id="lab-apply-json">Open JSON draft</button><p class="lab-small">Only the supported workflow settings are accepted. Code and test answers cannot be included.</p></details>
          <div id="lab-share-result" hidden><label for="lab-share-url">Shareable draft link</label><input id="lab-share-url" readonly /><a id="lab-open-share" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open this draft</a><p class="lab-small">Anyone with this link can open their own copy. The link includes workflow settings and the review note, but no test answers or selected debts. It is not a shared live document.</p></div>
          <p id="lab-file-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </section>
        <section class="lab-panel lab-flow" aria-labelledby="lab-flow-title"><h2 id="lab-flow-title">2. Follow the steps</h2><p class="lab-small">Select any node to read its role. Use Step through, then Next step, to inspect what it receives and produces.</p><ol id="lab-nodes" aria-label="Draft graph nodes"></ol><p id="lab-order-note" class="lab-small"></p></section>
        <section class="lab-panel lab-inspector" aria-labelledby="lab-inspector-title"><h2 id="lab-inspector-title">3. Inspect a node</h2><div id="lab-inspection">Select a node to inspect it.</div></section>
      </div>
      <section class="lab-panel lab-inputs" aria-labelledby="lab-input-title"><h2 id="lab-input-title">Test the eleven guide questions</h2><p>The numbered cards follow the attachment's order: marriage first, prior bankruptcy second, then household, income, property and debt. Change these invented answers and rerun. The inspector shows the validated values carried through LangGraph. Conditional questions use <em>not applicable</em> when their parent answer is no.</p>
        <label for="lab-example">Load an invented example</label><select id="lab-example"><optgroup label="Options to discuss"><option value="ordinary_debt_relief">Ordinary debts: Chapter 7 discussion</option><option value="keep_home_roadmap">Home arrears: Chapter 13 discussion</option><option value="debt_specific_review">Student loans, taxes and support</option><option value="earlier_case_review">Earlier bankruptcy to review</option></optgroup><optgroup label="Budget and uncertainty"><option value="shortfall" selected>Monthly shortfall</option><option value="remaining">Money remaining</option><option value="uncertain_range">Uncertain range</option><option value="unknown_income">Unknown income with foreclosure concern</option><option value="invalid_income">Invalid income with foreclosure concern</option><option value="overlapping_payments">Payments already included in expenses</option><option value="zero_income">Zero income</option></optgroup></select>
        <button type="button" id="lab-reset-answers">Reset test answers</button>

        <section class="lab-answer-section lab-guide-question" data-guide-question="1" aria-labelledby="lab-marriage-heading"><h3 id="lab-marriage-heading"><span class="lab-guide-number">1.</span> Are you married?</h3><div class="lab-choice-grid lab-context-grid"><div><label for="lab-marital-status">Answer</label><select id="lab-marital-status"><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="not_married">No</option><option value="married">Yes</option></select></div><div><label for="lab-spouse-filing">If yes, will your spouse be filing bankruptcy with you?</label><select id="lab-spouse-filing"><option value="not_applicable">Not applicable</option><option value="unsure">Unsure</option><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Yes</option></select></div></div></section>

        <section class="lab-answer-section lab-guide-question" data-guide-question="2" aria-labelledby="lab-prior-heading"><h3 id="lab-prior-heading"><span class="lab-guide-number">2.</span> Have you ever filed for bankruptcy before?</h3><div class="lab-choice-grid lab-context-grid"><div><label for="lab-prior-bankruptcy">Answer</label><select id="lab-prior-bankruptcy"><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Yes</option></select></div><div><label for="lab-prior-bankruptcy-recency">If yes, how long ago did you file?</label><select id="lab-prior-bankruptcy-recency"><option value="not_applicable">Not applicable</option><option value="more_than_8_years">More than 8 years ago</option><option value="less_than_8_years">Less than 8 years ago</option><option value="unknown">Unsure</option></select></div></div><p class="lab-small">This range never calculates a filing or discharge waiting period.</p></section>

        <section class="lab-answer-section lab-guide-question" data-guide-question="3" aria-labelledby="lab-household-heading"><h3 id="lab-household-heading"><span class="lab-guide-number">3.</span> How many people live in your household?</h3><div class="lab-choice-grid lab-context-grid"><div><label for="lab-household-size">Answer</label><select id="lab-household-size"><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="one">One (just me)</option><option value="two">Two</option><option value="three">Three</option><option value="four">Four</option><option value="five_plus">Five or more</option></select></div></div></section>

        <section class="lab-answer-section lab-guide-question" data-guide-question="4" aria-labelledby="lab-income-heading"><h3 id="lab-income-heading"><span class="lab-guide-number">4.</span> What is the total gross household income per month?</h3><div class="lab-choice-grid lab-context-grid"><div><label for="lab-gross-monthly-income-band">Answer</label><select id="lab-gross-monthly-income-band"><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="under_4000">Less than $4,000</option><option value="4000_5999">$4,000 - $6,000</option><option value="6000_7999">$6,000 - $8,000</option><option value="8000_9999">$8,000 - $10,000</option><option value="10000_11999">$10,000 - $12,000</option><option value="12000_13999">$12,000 - $14,000</option><option value="14000_15999">$14,000 - $16,000</option><option value="16000_plus">$16,000 +</option></select></div></div><p class="lab-small">The band and household size organize a consultation. This lab does not multiply the band by twelve or compare it with a median-income table.</p></section>

        <section class="lab-answer-section lab-guide-question" data-guide-question="5" aria-labelledby="lab-home-heading"><h3 id="lab-home-heading"><span class="lab-guide-number">5.</span> Do you own a home?</h3><div class="lab-choice-grid lab-context-grid"><div><label for="lab-home-ownership">Answer</label><select id="lab-home-ownership"><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Yes</option></select></div><div><label for="lab-mortgage-status">If yes, are you current on your mortgage payments?</label><select id="lab-mortgage-status"><option value="not_applicable">Not applicable</option><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="current">Yes, current</option><option value="behind">No, behind</option><option value="no_loan">No mortgage</option></select></div><div><label for="lab-home-equity">How much equity may be in your home?</label><select id="lab-home-equity"><option value="not_applicable">Not applicable</option><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="none_or_negative">None or about even</option><option value="some">Some equity</option></select></div><label class="lab-debt-choice lab-inline-debt" for="lab-debt-mortgage"><input type="checkbox" id="lab-debt-mortgage" name="lab-debtKinds" value="mortgage" data-debt-kind /><span>Mortgage debt applies to this invented example</span></label></div><p class="lab-small">Equity and ownership can raise review questions. No state exemption rule is enabled.</p></section>

        <section class="lab-answer-section lab-guide-question" data-guide-question="6" aria-labelledby="lab-vehicle-heading"><h3 id="lab-vehicle-heading"><span class="lab-guide-number">6.</span> Do you have a vehicle?</h3><div class="lab-choice-grid lab-context-grid"><div><label for="lab-vehicle-ownership">Answer</label><select id="lab-vehicle-ownership"><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Yes</option></select></div><div><label for="lab-vehicle-loan-status">If yes, are you current on your car payments?</label><select id="lab-vehicle-loan-status"><option value="not_applicable">Not applicable</option><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="current">Yes, current</option><option value="behind">No, behind</option><option value="no_loan">No vehicle loan</option></select></div><div><label for="lab-vehicle-equity">How much equity may be in your vehicle?</label><select id="lab-vehicle-equity"><option value="not_applicable">Not applicable</option><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="none_or_negative">None or about even</option><option value="some">Some equity</option></select></div><label class="lab-debt-choice lab-inline-debt" for="lab-debt-auto"><input type="checkbox" id="lab-debt-auto" name="lab-debtKinds" value="auto" data-debt-kind /><span>Vehicle-loan debt applies to this invented example</span></label></div><p class="lab-small">Equity and ownership can raise review questions. No state exemption rule is enabled.</p></section>

        <section class="lab-answer-section lab-guide-question" data-guide-question="7" aria-labelledby="lab-assets-heading"><h3 id="lab-assets-heading"><span class="lab-guide-number">7.</span> Do you have any other significant assets?</h3><div class="lab-choice-grid lab-context-grid"><div><label for="lab-significant-assets">Answer</label><select id="lab-significant-assets"><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Yes</option></select></div></div></section>

        <section class="lab-answer-section lab-guide-question" data-guide-question="8" aria-labelledby="lab-taxes-heading"><h3 id="lab-taxes-heading"><span class="lab-guide-number">8.</span> Do you owe any taxes?</h3><label for="lab-tax-debt">Answer</label><select id="lab-tax-debt"><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Yes</option></select></section>

        <section class="lab-answer-section lab-guide-question" data-guide-question="9" aria-labelledby="lab-support-heading"><h3 id="lab-support-heading"><span class="lab-guide-number">9.</span> Do you owe any child support or alimony?</h3><label for="lab-support-debt">Answer</label><select id="lab-support-debt"><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Yes</option></select></section>

        <section class="lab-answer-section lab-guide-question" data-guide-question="10" aria-labelledby="lab-student-heading"><h3 id="lab-student-heading"><span class="lab-guide-number">10.</span> Do you owe any student loans?</h3><label for="lab-student-debt">Answer</label><select id="lab-student-debt"><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Yes</option></select></section>

        <section class="lab-answer-section lab-guide-question" data-guide-question="11" aria-labelledby="lab-debts-heading"><h3 id="lab-debts-heading"><span class="lab-guide-number">11.</span> Do you owe credit cards, personal loans, lines of credit, medical bills or other unsecured debt?</h3><label for="lab-unsecured-debt">Answer</label><select id="lab-unsecured-debt"><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Yes</option></select><div id="lab-unsecured-details" class="lab-added-followup" hidden><fieldset class="lab-debt-fieldset" aria-describedby="lab-debt-hint"><legend>Optional lab detail: which ordinary unsecured debts?</legend><p id="lab-debt-hint" class="lab-small">Choose any that fit the invented example. These details organize questions and reading; they do not decide discharge. If none is chosen, the lab uses the same broad ordinary-debt mapping as the public checkup.</p><div class="lab-debt-grid"><label class="lab-debt-choice" for="lab-debt-credit_card"><input type="checkbox" id="lab-debt-credit_card" name="lab-debtKinds" value="credit_card" data-debt-kind /><span>Credit cards</span></label><label class="lab-debt-choice" for="lab-debt-personal_loan"><input type="checkbox" id="lab-debt-personal_loan" name="lab-debtKinds" value="personal_loan" data-debt-kind /><span>Personal loans or lines of credit</span></label><label class="lab-debt-choice" for="lab-debt-medical"><input type="checkbox" id="lab-debt-medical" name="lab-debtKinds" value="medical" data-debt-kind /><span>Medical bills</span></label></div></fieldset></div></section>

        <details class="lab-advanced-drawer"><summary>Advanced test inputs not asked in the public checkup</summary>
          <p class="lab-small">These lab-only inputs expose more of the existing graph for development review. They are separate from the attachment's eleven questions.</p>
          <section class="lab-answer-section lab-advanced-context" data-graph-context aria-labelledby="lab-priority-heading"><h3 id="lab-priority-heading">Additional graph context</h3><div class="lab-choice-grid"><div><label for="lab-urgency">Invented urgent concern</label><select id="lab-urgency"><option value="none">None reported</option><option value="foreclosure">Foreclosure</option><option value="garnishment">Garnishment</option><option value="repossession">Repossession</option><option value="lawsuit">Lawsuit</option><option value="deadline">Deadline</option><option value="unknown">Not sure</option></select></div><div class="lab-added-followup"><p class="lab-context-label">Lab-only input</p><label for="lab-main-goal">Main goal</label><select id="lab-main-goal"><option value="unsure">Not sure yet</option><option value="debt_relief">Get relief from debt</option><option value="keep_home">Keep a home</option><option value="keep_vehicle">Keep a vehicle</option><option value="stop_collection">Address collection pressure</option></select></div><div><label for="lab-debt-situation">Payment pressure</label><select id="lab-debt-situation"><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="keeping_up">Keeping up with payments</option><option value="falling_behind">Falling behind</option><option value="borrowing_for_basics">Borrowing to cover basic expenses</option><option value="balances_not_shrinking">Paying, but balances are not shrinking</option></select></div><div><label for="lab-income-regularity">Income regularity</label><select id="lab-income-regularity"><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="regular">Regular income</option><option value="irregular">Irregular income</option><option value="no_current_income">No current income</option></select></div><label class="lab-debt-choice lab-inline-debt" for="lab-debt-other"><input type="checkbox" id="lab-debt-other" name="lab-debtKinds" value="other" data-debt-kind /><span>Other or unclassified debt applies to this invented example</span></label></div></section>

          <section class="lab-budget" aria-labelledby="lab-budget-heading"><h3 id="lab-budget-heading">Optional monthly budget calculation</h3><p class="lab-small">The public eleven-question V2 does not ask for these figures. Unknown and zero stay different; ranges keep both ends.</p><div class="lab-money-grid">{moneyFields.map(([field,label,amount]) => <fieldset data-money-field={field}><legend>{label}</legend><label for={`lab-${field}-kind`}>Amount type</label><select id={`lab-${field}-kind`} data-money-kind><option value="estimate">Estimate</option><option value="exact">Reported amount</option><option value="range">Range</option><option value="unknown">Unknown</option><option value="not_provided">Not provided</option></select><label for={`lab-${field}-amount`} data-amount-label>Amount ($)</label><input id={`lab-${field}-amount`} data-money-amount inputmode="decimal" value={amount} /><div data-range-row hidden><label for={`lab-${field}-maximum`}>Maximum ($)</label><input id={`lab-${field}-maximum`} data-money-maximum inputmode="decimal" value={amount} /></div></fieldset>)}</div><label for="lab-separate">Are additional payments separate from expenses?</label><select id="lab-separate"><option value="yes">Yes, not already included</option><option value="no">No, already included</option><option value="unknown">Not sure</option><option value="not_provided">Not provided</option></select></section>
        </details>
        <p class="lab-small">Select <strong>Build the issue list and discussion path</strong> in the node inspector to see which validated facts reached the deterministic branches. The result remains a discussion starting point, not a filing, eligibility, exemption or discharge verdict.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="lab-panel lab-comparison" aria-labelledby="lab-comparison-title"><h2 id="lab-comparison-title">Compare the result and options roadmap</h2><p class="lab-small">Both columns execute real LangGraph locally. The baseline runs the current Beta's default graph source, including its educational guidance. It is not a request to the public server or proof of that server's availability. Compare the explanation as well as the dollars.</p><div class="lab-results-grid"><article><h3>Current Beta logic</h3><div id="lab-baseline">Run an example to see the baseline.</div></article><article><h3>Your draft logic</h3><div id="lab-draft">Run an example to see the draft.</div></article></div><p id="lab-difference" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></section>
    </section>
    <p class="lab-footer-note">Nothing is automatically saved or uploaded by this tab. Download a workflow draft or create a link to keep its settings; invented answer selections are excluded. <a href="/bankruptcy-checkup-beta-workflow">Read the plain-language workflow explanation.</a></p>
  </section>
  <script is:inline src={scriptUrl}></script>
</Base>
<style is:global>
  .lab-main { padding-block: 2.5rem 4rem; }
  .lab-kicker { font-size: .8rem; letter-spacing: .09em; color: var(--sage-deep); font-weight: 700; }
  .lab-main h1 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem,3.3vw,2.7rem); max-width: 28ch; line-height: 1.15; }
  .lab-lead { font-size: 1.35rem; margin-block: 1rem; }
  .lab-notice { background: var(--off); border-left: 4px solid var(--sage); padding: 1rem 1.25rem; margin-block: 1.5rem; }
  .lab-decision-explanation { max-width: 65ch; }
  #checkup-workflow-lab { margin-top: 2rem; }
  #checkup-workflow-lab button, #checkup-workflow-lab input, #checkup-workflow-lab select, #checkup-workflow-lab textarea { font: inherit; }
  #checkup-workflow-lab button { padding: .6rem .8rem; border: 1px solid var(--sage-deep); border-radius: 5px; background: #fff; color: var(--sage-deep); cursor: pointer; }
  #checkup-workflow-lab button:hover { background: var(--off); }
  #checkup-workflow-lab button:disabled { color: #707670; border-color: #bcc3bc; cursor: default; }
  #checkup-workflow-lab button.lab-primary { color: #fff; background: var(--sage-deep); }
  #checkup-workflow-lab :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--sage); outline-offset: 3px; }
  #checkup-workflow-lab label { display: block; font-weight: 600; font-size: .9rem; margin-block: .85rem .25rem; }
  #checkup-workflow-lab input:not([type=file]):not([type=checkbox]), #checkup-workflow-lab select, #checkup-workflow-lab textarea { width: 100%; min-width: 0; background: #fff; color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid #aab3aa; border-radius: 4px; padding: .5rem; }
  #checkup-workflow-lab input:disabled { background: var(--off); color: #737973; }
  #checkup-workflow-lab input[type=file] { max-width: 100%; font-size: .85rem; }
  .lab-toolbar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .6rem; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  #lab-status { flex-basis: 100%; margin-block: .3rem; }
  .lab-workspace { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,1fr); gap: 1rem; align-items: start; }
  .lab-panel { min-width: 0; padding: 1.25rem; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 7px; }
  .lab-panel h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 0; }
  .lab-panel h3 { font-size: 1rem; }
  .lab-small { font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .lab-editor details { font-size: .85rem; margin-block: 1rem; }
  .lab-editor summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
  .lab-share-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; }
  #lab-file-status, #lab-difference { font-weight: 600; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  #lab-nodes { padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  #lab-nodes li { position: relative; padding-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  #lab-nodes li:not(:last-child)::after { content: '↓'; display: block; text-align: center; height: 1.2rem; color: var(--sage-deep); }
  #lab-nodes button { width: 100%; text-align: left; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.5rem 1fr; gap: .5rem; border-color: #b9c6ba; }
  #lab-nodes button[aria-pressed=true] { outline: 2px solid var(--sage-deep); }
  #lab-nodes button[data-state=done] { background: #edf3ee; }
  #lab-nodes button[data-state=waiting] { background: #fff5d9; border-color: #927426; }
  #lab-nodes small { display: block; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 400; margin-top: .2rem; }
  .lab-node-number { font-weight: 700; }
  #lab-inspection h3 { margin-block: .5rem; }
  #lab-inspection code { overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: .75rem; }
  #lab-inspection dl, .lab-results-grid dl { margin-block: 1rem; }
  #lab-inspection dt, .lab-results-grid dt { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--sage-deep); }
  #lab-inspection dd, .lab-results-grid dd { margin: 0 0 .7rem; font-weight: 600; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  #lab-inspection pre { max-height: 24rem; overflow: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: .75rem; background: var(--off); padding: .7rem; }
  .lab-inputs, .lab-comparison { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .lab-answer-section { margin-top: 1rem; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 5px; background: var(--off); }
  .lab-answer-section > h3 { margin-top: 0; }
  .lab-guide-question > h3 { display: flex; gap: .45rem; align-items: baseline; }
  .lab-guide-number { flex: 0 0 auto; color: var(--sage-deep); }
  .lab-added-followup { padding: .8rem; border: 1px dashed #9aa99b; border-radius: 5px; background: #fff; }
